    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yokai Survivor</strong> is a single-player survivor-like auto-shooter. Face relentless waves of twisted yokai in a cursed underworld, harvest precious fruits, and master powerful ninjutsu skills to turn the tide. Grow stronger with each run, unlock deadly abilities, and carve your path through the darkness. It\u2019s one ninja against a world of nightmares \u2014 how long can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Survive Relentless Yokai Hordes:<br>Face chaotic, fast-paced battles against swarms of supernatural enemies.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd77 Master Deadly Ninjutsus:<br>Unlock and upgrade a diverse arsenal of ninjutsu abilities, combining them for devastating combos.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26cf\ufe0f Harvest &amp; Progress:<br>Collect materials during runs to invest in permanent upgrades and traits, enhancing future attempts.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0c Endless Procedurally Generated Nightmares:<br>Each session offers a unique challenge with randomized enemy waves and arena layouts.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcc8 Meta-Progression That Sticks:<br>Persistent progression system allowing players to grow stronger over time and tailor their playstyle.</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yokai Survivor</strong> is a single-player survivor-like auto-shooter. Face relentless waves of twisted yokai in a cursed underworld, harvest precious fruits, and master powerful ninjutsu skills to turn the tide. Grow stronger with each run, unlock deadly abilities, and carve your path through the darkness. It\u2019s one ninja against a world of nightmares \u2014 how long can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Survive Relentless Yokai Hordes:<br>Face chaotic, fast-paced battles against swarms of supernatural enemies.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd77 Master Deadly Ninjutsus:<br>Unlock and upgrade a diverse arsenal of ninjutsu abilities, combining them for devastating combos.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26cf\ufe0f Harvest &amp; Progress:<br>Collect materials during runs to invest in permanent upgrades and traits, enhancing future attempts.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0c Endless Procedurally Generated Nightmares:<br>Each session offers a unique challenge with randomized enemy waves and arena layouts.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcc8 Meta-Progression That Sticks:<br>Persistent progression system allowing players to grow stronger over time and tailor their playstyle.</strong></p></li></ul>",
